===================================================

This project platform, including its visual themes, neon color styling configurations, 
custom interface frameworks, and specific deployment file packages designed for 
the PlayStation 4 (firmware version 13.02 through 13.52), is the exclusive 
intellectual property of Ahmed Essam (GitHub: scorpion511).

SYSTEM CONTROL & USAGE POLICY:

1. OWNERSHIP FLAG & BRAND INTEGRITY
   The user interface identity "SCORP HOST" and its signature styling assets 
   are uniquely authored by Ahmed Essam. Any public deployment, mirror site, 
   or network fork of this repository must keep the original credits ("Designed 
   By Ahmed Essam") visible on the front-end layout at all times.

2. REPACKAGING & PLAGIARISM RESTRICTIONS
   No external party or entity is authorized to strip this repository of its 
   rightful ownership text, replace the author's signature with their own, 
   or place a conflicting layout agreement on unauthorized duplicates. Doing 
   so voids any permission to host or reuse these custom web framework packages.

3. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENT CLAUSE
   This deployment package bundles standard open-source core script engines and 
   binary payloads (including goldhen.bin, payload2.bin, and system offset 
   tables) to ensure console execution functionality. These specific background 
   binaries maintain their own respective community roots and are not claimed 
   under this front-end interface copyright.

4. LIABILITY & RISK ACCEPATANCE
   THIS INTERFACE PLATFORM IS RENDERED "AS IS" FOR HOMEBREW EVALUATION PURPOSES. 
   THE AUTHOR ACCEPTS ABSOLUTELY ZERO LIABILITY OR WARRANTY FOR SYSTEM CRASHES, 
   HARDWARE FREEZES, SOFTWARE GLITCHES, OR OPERATIONAL CORRUPTION THAT MAY OCCUR 
